    507  56a3							; What SPACE and the keytar's buttons do (menu: SPACE, ... BUTTON):
    508  56a3							;   held     MUTE, BEND DOWN, BEND UP, VIBRATO, TREMOLO, ARP, STUTTER,
    509  56a3							;	      VINYL STOP, GLIDE, SUSTAIN, OCTAVE UP, REPEAT, FILTER SWEEP,
    510  56a3							;	      BEAT FILL, TAPE WOBBLE, WIDE
    511  56a3							;   a press  TAP TEMPO, BEAT ON/OFF, NEXT SOUND; or NOTHING
    512  56a3							; A held action can be held by several at once; it ends when the last lets go.
    513  56a3							;
