    362  6ab2							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    363  6ab2							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    364  6ab2							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    365  6ab2							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    366  6ab2							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    367  6ab2							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    368  6ab2							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    369  6ab2							; press).
